      "factual_description": "The Gil Evans Project makes its debut at The Pocket on August 27-28, 2026, with sets at 7:00 PM and 9:00 PM each night. Led by Ryan Truesdell with Mike Rodriguez as trumpet soloist, the ensemble performs the complete music of Birth of the Cool as part of the Miles Davis centennial. The Pocket publishes the full eleven-person lineup and describes the engagement as a celebration of the historic Davis/Evans collaboration; vocalist Wendy Gilles independently lists the same engagement and personnel on her official schedule.",
